    "title": "Cooking Madness: A Chef's Game",
    "description": "Hey, psssst! You there...come over here, listen!\r\nYou are THE CHEF we\u2019ve been looking for !\r\n\r\nHave you ever dreamed of cooking delicious dishes from all over the world and discovering exotic cultures? You can achieve those dreams in Cooking Madness! Come and try one of the most addictive FREE time-management cooking games of 2024!\r\n\r\nEXPLORE amazing restaurants and exotic foods along your worldwide journey \r\n- Favored by millions of global players, Cooking Madness proudly features more than 67 high-quality theme restaurants, 2600+ riveting levels to conquer and hundreds of ingredients to cook with!\r\n- From the spicy flavors of Mexico to the culinary sophistication of Paris, from hearty burgers to delicate sushi, surprises await you in every exciting area of the map to be unlocked! Fill your chef's collection handbook by perfecting hundreds of delicious recipes from all over the world!\r\n\r\nPRACTICE your cooking techniques and time-management - a real Mad Chef makes uses of fingers AND brain!\r\n- Hungry diners are ravenous for tasty dishes! A few taps on the screen, and voila! You are preparing, cooking and serving scrumptious meals just like a professional chef!\r\n- But wait, speed isn't everything, strategy is key! Can you prepare the right ingredients, juggle multiple dishes, and serve each customer just in time to collect the biggest bonus? Test your time-management skills and concoct the perfect strategy for each challenging level!\r\n\r\nUPGRADE your culinary arsenal and earn achievement rewards to reach the zenith of the cooking world\r\n- To create the most exquisite dishes, you'll need the finest ingredients and top-tier equipment. Earn coins from levels and reinvest them into upgrading every facet of your kitchen!\r\n- With the achievement handbook in the game, you not only can view the milestones you have reached on the path of becoming a master chef, but also claim some well-deserved rewards! Use these to further boost your progress and never stop!\r\n\r\nENJOY some juicy in-game content and unparalleled gameplay\r\n- Immerse yourself in festive atmospheres with limited-time restaurants. From Halloween to Mother's Day, St. Patrick's Day to Dragon Boat Festival, savor the magic of a cultural adventure!\r\n- With regular updates featuring new restaurants and content, our chefs are always kept on their toes!\r\n- Fumbled on a level and low on energy? Fear not! Join a team, call up friends on Facebook and send energy to each other. Share your newest culinary triumphs and succumb to the cooking fever together!\r\n- Open your restaurants anytime, anywhere, with or without an internet connection. Unleash the joy of cooking, no strings attached!\r\n\r\nThis is THE cooking game you have been searching for! Don\u2019t wait any longer, don your apron and immerse yourself in a real cooking craze!\r\n\r\nStay tuned with our social media for the latest news & giveaways, and find your friends and teammates in our friendly players' community via:\r\n>>> Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/cookingmadness.chef \r\n>>> Official Fan Group: https://bit.ly/cookingmadnessofficialgroup\r\n>>> Email: game.support@zentertain.net",
